CHAPTER.VERS:
And David divided the people in three [parts], a third part under the hand of Joab, and a third part under the hand of Abishai the son of Zeruiah, Joab's brother, and a third part under the hand of Ittai the Gittite. And the king said to the people, I will surely go forth with you

          {+}
         myself also.

And the king said to them, What seems best to you

          {+}
         I will do. And the king stood by the gate-side, and all the people went out by hundreds and by thousands.
